Two stories

Write two stories. In `signup`, the `Browser` posts to `Accounts`, and
`Accounts` sends a mail through `Mailer`. In `reset`, the `Browser` asks
`Accounts` for a reset, and `Accounts` sends a link through `Mailer`.
---
story signup {
  Browser -> Accounts: post
  Accounts -> Mailer: welcome mail
}
story reset {
  Browser -> Accounts: reset
  Accounts -> Mailer: reset link
}
